# SC secret material.
#
# Only the ENCRYPTED registry `.sc/secrets.yaml` is committed. The
# per-operator/CI config (which holds the private key that decrypts it)
# and every plaintext credential stay local, and in CI are materialised
# by `sc secrets reveal --force` from the single org-level `SC_CONFIG`.
#
# See README.md §Storage for what this repo keeps here (the go-embedb
# deploy key) and why.
.sc/cfg.*.yaml
!.sc/secrets.yaml

# Deploy-key private halves are SC-managed — stored encrypted in
# .sc/secrets.yaml, revealed into these paths by `sc secrets reveal`.
.sc/deploy-keys/